# cross lane downloads each component by SHA into the same CUDA root; nvcc itself
# stays the x64 host tool. All paths/versions/hashes from
# compute/cuda/redist/redistrib_${CUDA_VERSION}.json, component `windows-arm64`.
# The component versions differ per library (cublas 13.8.0.4, cufft 12.4.0.43,
# ...) -- that is NVIDIA's layout, not a typo. The set is the ORT CUDA EP's link
# closure plus ORT's runtime dlopens (cudart/cuda, cublas/cublasLt, curand,
# cufft, nvJitLink), the OpenCV NPP/solver/sparse additions, and nvrtc/cupti
